==Strategy==
Use the starting Gary Gories at the start to build up a sizeable stack of [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]]. Send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] when you can. Teacher A is outranged by King Dragon and Bahamut, so he isn't much of a worry as long as you can get a few good hits on him. In truth, it's Ms. Madonna's Knockback Waves that will slowly be pushing you back, so killing her as quickly as possible is paramount. If you own [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], you can negate her gimmick almost entirely.

